HOW TO CHECK THE SERVER PERFOMANCE:
top 
htop : yum install htop -y

head file1	: shows first 10 lines in a file
head -5 file1	: shows first 5 lines in a file
head -15 file1	: shows first 15 lines in a file
tail file1	: shows bottom 10 lines in a file
tail -5 file1	: shows bottom 5 lines in a file
tail -15 file1	: shows bottom 15 lines in a file
sed -n '5,15p' file1: to print line 5 to 15 
wc (word count)	"wc file1"	: to show lines, words and characters.
